{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"python3 -c 'import json; a=json.load(open(\\\"docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/week/packet-A1.json\\\")); [print(x[\\\"article\\\"],len(x[\\\"text\\\"]),x[\\\"title\\\"]) for x in a]'\"","aggregated_output":"1 9871 NVIDIA Isaac ROS 5.0 Advances Agentic, Open Source Robotics Development | NVIDIA Blog\n2 3334 Google Is Taking Its AI Chips Outside the Cloud. Nvidia Just Got a New Sovereign-AI Rival\n3 3176 Nvidia stock is approaching its cheapest valuation in a decade despite booming profits\n4 6650 CONTROL Resonant, Gears E-Day, Witcher 3 & AION 2 Game Ready\n5 3247 Sea to adopt Nvidia's Vera Rubin platform; more Southeast Asian firms build with Nemotron\n6 3795 Sandisk vs. NVIDIA: Which AI Stock Is the Better Buy Now?\n7 1046 Nvidia Slips as Four Macs Attack Cloud Inference Economics\n8 4211 Nvidia establishes Israeli research group focused on AI for medicine and science\n9 3370 Nvidia Just Qualified Tesla and Vertiv Products for Its New AI-Factory Standard\n10 3562 NVIDIA Smooth Motion Now Runs on RTX 30 Series GPUs Thanks to NVSmooth30 Mod, RTX 3050 Laptop and RTX 3080 Confirmed Working\n11 2196 Apple Takes AI Fight Straight to Nvidia and Microsoft\n12 3369 IONQ Stock On Track To Hit Over 1-Month High On Nvidia Superion 256 Deployment, Quantum Error Decoder Breakthrough\n13 3935 I'm Buying More Nvidia Stock Right Now. Here's Why.\n14 9403 Efficient MoE Training for Biological Foundation Models | NVIDIA Technical Blog\n15 3204 How IonQ’s On‑Prem Quantum System At NVIDIA (NVDA) Has Changed Its Investment Story\n16 5656 Nvidia CEO says 'we have to shut the labs down' if AI experiments are unsafe — Jensen cites civil and criminal liability over rogue agents, but says frontier AI lab fears are a 'distraction,' not a call for regulation\n17 5186 NVIDIA's RTX Kit adds RTX Mega Geometry 2.0 and lays the foundation for RTX Neural Texture Compression\n18 4168 NVIDIA's $279B Supply Commitments: Can These Secure Its Growth Runway?\n19 4076 Nvidia Raised Its Dividend 2,400%, but a $10,000 Investment Still Pays Just $44 a Year\n20 4937 AMD Just Joined Nvidia in the $1 Trillion Club. At $614, Wall Street Is Paying Too Much for a Distant No. 2.\n21 4290 Nvidia Would Have to Add Almost a Whole Broadcom to Reach $7 Trillion\n22 2841 Heads of SpaceX, Apple, Nvidia and AI giants joined Trump and Xi for dinner\n23 11307 8 wild quotes from Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang's latest interview on AI and why they should concern you\n24 2853 Nvidia (NVDA) Is Central To New Global AI Rules Debate\n25 4860 Nvidia Trades Near Its 52-Week High at Its Cheapest Valuation in a Decade. History Says This Is What $1,000 Invested Could Be Worth by 2030.\n26 3984 Why NVIDIA's Most Powerful GPU Is So Rarely Sold To Consumers\n27 4357 Jim Cramer Says Buy 2 Artificial Intelligence (AI) Stocks Up 875% and 1,400% Since 2023\n28 3652 Nvidia Vera Rubin Claims 3.7x More AI Performance, But Who Can Afford It?\n29 3950 3 Reasons Why Nvidia Fits Warren Buffett's Investment Style\n30 5826 Nvidia had quietly taken 40GB of my C: drive for a feature that barely mattered at all\n31 2193 China chipmaking stocks tumble as Beijing reportedly mulls allowing Nvidia sales\n32 2376 Student protesters confront NVIDIA executive over AI’s climate impact\n33 15221 NVIDIA Launches Open Agent Safety Platform to Secure Agents From Testing to Deployment | NVIDIA Newsroom\n34 7620 CNBC | VERSANT Press Room\n35 2842 Nvidia launches security platform to keep AI agents from going rogue\n36 2229 Nvidia Thinks Its Stock Is Cheap. It’s Buying Back $150 Billion.\n37 7165 Gecko Robotics works with NVIDIA to add AI agent security and control\n38 2462 Jim Cramer on Nvidia's $150 billion buyback expansion\n39 1389 Nvidia Just Put a Record $150 Billion Behind Its Own Stock\n40 3223 Nvidia is launching a security platform to stop rogue AI agents from hacking systems\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
